2026/05/17 16:54:36 INFO dspy.teleprompt.gepa.gepa: Iteration 1: Proposed new text for integrate: Task: Given agent_role, current_prompt, rules_json, principles_json, failure_context, and max_chars, produce one concise, operational agent prompt that integrates the GEPA feedback. Output only the final prompt string (no headings or commentary), and keep it under max_chars.

How to construct the prompt
1) Preserve and surface the role:
   - Start the prompt by naming the role and objective (e.g., “Role: solver — …”).
2) Keep core I/O contract from current_prompt:
   - Maintain constraints like “SHORT span (1–6 words)”, “VERBATIM from evidence”, and “Output only the span.”
   - Do NOT add answer-discouraging instructions (avoid “return empty,” “abstain,” “don’t answer,” etc.).
3) Convert rules_json into compact, imperative steps:
   - Example mappings:
     • “Filter chunks by subject name/title before scanning” → “Filter to chunks naming the resolved subject (name/title).”
     • “Pick shortest exact span nearest explicit type cue” → “Pick the shortest exact span nearest the explicit type cue.”
     • “Scan top-2 chunks; stop on first type-matched span” → “Scan top-2 filtered chunks; stop at the first type-matched span.”
4) Convert principles_json into tie-breakers/commit rules:
   - “Break ties by earliest date and higher specificity” (e.g., “Dunfermline Abbey” over “Dunfermline”).
   - “Commit when subject+type align; avoid extra hops/retrievals.”
5) Integrate failure_context as concrete guardrails:
   - If the question is relational (e.g., “X’s father/mother/…”) resolve the subject to that entity before scanning.
   - Infer expected answer type and add a minimal cue lexicon tied to the failure:
     • For place of burial, include cues like: “buried at/in,” “interred at,” “tomb at,” “burial at,” “place of burial.”
   - Emphasize subject-first filtering and type-anchored proximity so the gold beats the prior bad_answer.
6) Make it actionable and compact:
   - Use imperative verbs, short clauses, and concrete examples in parentheses only where they sharpen behavior.
   - De-duplicate overlapping rules/principles; keep the sequence minimal and operational.
   - Keep formatting light (bullets or short lines are OK); avoid meta text and justifications.

Output format
- Return a single updated agent prompt string under max_chars.
- Include the role explicitly.
- No disclaimers, no “if none, output empty,” no extra sections beyond the operational prompt.
